# ==============================================================================
# CRITICAL FOR OPEN-SOURCE CDN (jsDelivr / GitHub Releases)
# The dist/ directory MUST be tracked and committed to GitHub so that
# jsDelivr can serve https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/USERNAME/REPO@VERSION/dist/...
